log	"     |                    ^"
log	"   hint: `import std.file.{File}` selects it, `import std.file.*` takes the module's whole vocabulary bare, and `import std.file` lets you write `file.File`"
log	""
log	"error: type `Vector<File, GlobalAllocator>` has no method `copy`: requires `T: ExplicitCopy`, and `File` does not conform"
